bmo-agency

The cache-siren crate is derived from the cache-siren project, carried forward through
bmo-cache-siren.

The cache-lifetime judgement and the keeping of an account's usage windows that the crate holds come
from the cache watch that project designed and built, carried forward through bmo-cache-siren. This
repository carries them forward with its own changes.

The upstream project's licence could not be confirmed, so the cache-siren crate carries no licence
declaration and is not covered by the repository's MIT licence.
